<title>USA: Labor Ready June same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready June same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$31.5	$14.8	+113	  +51</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended	 June 27.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			   Labor Ready Inc</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said its year-to-date sales increased by 108 percent and same store sales increased by 45 percent.</p>
</text>
